      including students with no CNIC at all, so the roster could not distinguish "held, hidden"
      from "never collected" — which is the actual question that column answers. Now NULL when
      `cnic_encrypted IS NULL`.
- [x] **Roster screen rebuilt** on `Students.dc.html`: `lib/students/{contract,presenter}.ts`
      (the presenter owns every derived figure — initials, room meta, rent+mess, tab counts,
