- [x] **CSV export is real** — a route handler under `apps/web/src/app` pages the API 100 at a time
      (its `limit` clamp would otherwise truncate an export silently at 100 students), honours the
      current tab/search/sort, neutralises spreadsheet formula injection on the way out, and ships
      a UTF-8 BOM so Excel does not mangle Pakistani names. PDF export is **not** built.

#### Deliberate deviations from the sketch — each one is a rule from authority #1 or a data fact
- **No ID column.** The sketch's first column is `#002`; `students` has no per-hostel sequential
  number and inventing one is a schema decision (a per-tenant sequence + backfill), not a UI one.
- **One row action (View), not four.** Edit, Shift room and Delete have no destination on the web
  app yet — 25 rows × 3 dead buttons is 75 controls that do nothing.
- **Active pills are grey.** `DESIGN_RULES.md`: pills are grey unless the state is actionable.
  Cancelling is amber and Blacklisted is red because both demand an action; Active is nine rows
  in ten and colouring it drowns the two that matter.
- **Nationality pills are all grey** (the sketch tints Afghan amber). Not an actionable state.
- **One neutral avatar**, not the sketch's four-colour rotation — the rotation is keyed to row
  index, so it changes when a student moves page, and "no rainbow" is an explicit rule.
- **Actions in the toolbar, not the app header.** The header is a shared client component;
  threading a server-rendered button into it needs a post-hydration portal, which would leave the
  screen's primary action missing from first paint and absent without JavaScript.
- **Search placeholder names only what is searched.** The sketch offers ID, CNIC, email and floor;
  CNIC is AES-GCM with a random IV, so its ciphertext can never be ILIKE-matched — a box that
  lists a field it ignores makes the operator conclude the student is not there.
- **No Unpaid column** (the old screen had one) — the redesign drops it; dues live on
  `/payments/defaulters`. Flagged in case that was not intended.

#### Verified / not verified
- [x] `tsc --noEmit` clean (web + api) · `eslint src` clean · `next build` green, 14 routes.
- [x] **Generated CSS audited** (the session-11 lesson): all 18 new utilities emit real rules,
      including `duration-fast` → `--tw-duration` + `transition-duration`.
- [x] Production server started; `/students` and `/students/export` both 307 to `/login`
      unauthenticated — the routes run server-side without crashing.
- [ ] ⚠️ **Not rendered against real data, and cannot be yet.** `.env.local` points at the staging
