- [x] **`API_BASE_URL`** set for production / preview / development.
- Considered and rejected: a legacy `builds: [{ src: "apps/web/package.json", use: "@vercel/next" }]`
  block would work repo-only, but it opts the project out of zero-config and the newer framework
  integration. Not worth shipping a degraded platform path to avoid one click.
